is Titan to drain the energy of one of his Redcap Titans and absorb its strength. [TCG:LGS-071]\n\n== Abilities ==\nThis Titan can drain the energy of weaker Titans and absorb their power to make itself stronger. [TCG:LGS-071]","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox Titan\n| image   = Unnamed Titan Absorb Strength.jpg\n| attack  = ?\n| defense = ?\n| type    = [[Yama-Titan]]\n| size    = Average\n| ability = Absorb Strength\n| users   = [[The Professor]]\n| first   = [[TCG:LGS-071|LGS-071]]\n}}'''Unnamed Titan 014''' is a [[Yama-Titan]] that wears red samurai armor and a stylized kabuto helmet with two horns. Its face is painted like a kabuki performer, like that of [[Kabuki]], while it wields lightning in place of its lower arms. \n\n== History ==\nThe Professor once used this Titan to drain the energy of one of his [[Redcap]] Titans and absorb its strength. {{Source|TCG:LGS-071|LGS-071}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nThis Titan can drain the energy of weaker Titans and absorb their power to make itself stronger. {{Source|TCG:LGS-071|LGS-071}}\n\n\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Yama-Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:Unnamed Titans]]\n[[Category:Average Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{YamaBox}}","categories":["Average Titans","Organization Titans","TCG Titans","Titans","Unnamed Titans","Yama-Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Yama-Titan","label":"Yama-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2837","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Yama-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Yama-Titans"},{"target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-071","label":"LGS-071","target_id":"huntik:page:10309","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-071","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A10309"},{"target_title":"Yama-Titan","label":"Yama-Titan","ta